  shortName: Tube 2
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 655  \xB7  Dec 23, 2022"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 2 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
