  displayName: Depot tube 8
  shortName: Tube 8
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 680  \xB7  Jan 18, 2023"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 8 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 680 (8 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 680 (2023-01-18)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
  photos:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 92de2f9f37ac281428337fb6601a0696, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground under the rover, just after the drop
    credit: "WATSON  \xB7  Sol 680  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech/MSSS"
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4c9242d24ca3de445a539331235c7b5d, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground after the rover backed away
    credit: "Front Hazcam  \xB7  Sol 681  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech"
  placeByLonLat: 1
  longitude: 77.408505
  latitude: 18.453005
  revealRadius: 4
