  displayName: Depot tube 6
  shortName: Tube 6
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 672  \xB7  Jan 10, 2023"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 6 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 672 (6 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 672 (2023-01-10)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
  photos:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 74bc8e536c43122419823857aa98f070, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground under the rover, just after the drop
