  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 70a0e7291f2e2df428d1f71bb6b173b7, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground after the rover backed away
    credit: "Front Hazcam  \xB7  Sol 674  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech"
