  when: "Sols 509 & 516  \xB7  Jul 27 & Aug 3, 2022"
  activity: Drilled two rock cores, Hazeltop and Bearwallow, from the Wildcat Ridge outcrop and sealed them in sample tubes. The material is sedimentary rock.
  subtitle: "Rock Core  \xB7  Sedimentary"
